// Where each scoreboard row sits. The scoreboard is the one screen drawn row by row from the cell of the page called score_list, because its rows are a list of five, not five cells of the page.

// The top of the row of scoreboard metric gym_metric: under the heading of the score_list cell, one step per metric.
gym_metric_top(int gym_metric) {
  int[] gym_list = gym_rectangle_of("score_list");
  int gym_top = gym_list[1] + (import gym_metric_head) + gym_metric * (import gym_metric_step);
} return int gym_top;
